easoning.text","text":"We need modify repo. Need inspect. Task complex multi-step, use todo. Need follow user asks find cause fix regression test all behavior. Need inspect files. First maybe status, tree. We can use task explore for codebase preferred, but need actual reads. Let's start todo and parallel glob/read likely.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_1e61c8da5001WOsIukr9a6INkB","sessionID":"ses_e19e37d77ffeBadt3udLmrManh","messageID":"msg_1e61c8429001dMuQglicv1uGtb"}}
