alid lines: read_statement list returns generator iteration and raises before returning, so no adds. Fine.\n\nQuestion asks \"Everything that works today must keep working the same way.\" We modified behavior intentionally malformed Rabo. Positive plus now works. Could existing behavior where malformed Rabo imported None have been relied on? No. Good.\n\nNeed possibly enforce transaction amount non-None at model boundary to avoid persisted existing malformed transactions. But broad fix could impact loaded old data. Let's inspect JSON store.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_1e61fcb24001ROwp6zJx31uVxS","sessionID":"ses_e19e37d77ffeBadt3udLmrManh","messageID":"msg_1e61fba41001PmQoc2RnZ0jQJA"}}
